{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 17,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Prayer of David. Hear the right, O LORD, attend to my cry, give ear to my prayer, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that goeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not out of feigned lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let my sentence come forth from thy presence; let thy eyes behold the things that are equal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast proved my heart; thou hast visited ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the night; thou hast tried me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shalt find nothing; I have purposed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my mouth shall not transgress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Concerning the works of men, by the word of thy lips I have kept ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the paths of the destroyer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Uphold my goings in thy paths, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my footsteps slip not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have called upon thee, for thou wilt hear me, O God: incline thy ear to me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and hear",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my speech.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Show thy wonderful loving-kindness, O thou that savest by thy right hand them who put their trust ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from those that rise up ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "against them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep me as the apple of the eye, hide me under the shade of thy wings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From the wicked that oppress me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my deadly enemies, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " encompass me,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are inclosed in their own fat: with their mouth they speak proudly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have now compassed us in our steps: they have set their eyes bowing down to the earth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Like as a lion ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " is greedy of his prey, and as it were a young lion lurking in secret places.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, O LORD disappoint him, cast him down: deliver my soul from the wicked, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy sword:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From men ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy hand, O LORD, from men of the world, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who have",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their portion in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " life, and whose belly thou fillest with thy hid ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "treasure",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": they are full of children, and leave the rest of their ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "substance",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to their babes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.17.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for me, I shall behold thy face in righteousness: I shall be satisfied, when I awake, with thy likeness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
